# Chapter 1, How Initech 123 displays numbers: General format in a column
# 9 characters wide (the standard width), and a number too wide for the
# format it is given
A1 1234567
A2 12345678
A3 123456789012
A4 -123456789
A5 1/3
A6 1234567
do /rff2~a6~
show A1
show A2
show A3
show A4
show A5
show A6
do /wcs11~
show A6
